Upstream-Name: fast-rdp-server
Upstream-Contact: Marcel Ritter <marcel@linux-ng.de>
Source: https://github.com/linuxrrze/fast-rdp-server
Comment: fastrdp-proxy-module links fastrdp's FreeRDP build (fastrdp-freerdp3),
 which links the distribution's GPL-2+ FFmpeg. The module itself is
 Apache-2.0; loaded into freerdp-proxy it forms part of a combined work
 distributed under GPL-3.0-or-later terms (see docs/licensing.md and the
 copyright file of fastrdp-freerdp3). The other packages only use
 Apache-2.0-compatible libraries (libpam, cJSON, Python, python3-cryptography).

